/-
Track 11.7-fusion / R4aa -- compiler-driven tenth half-time shell.

The endpoint support and adjacent-depth polynomial ratio are now generated by
the all-depth compilers.  This module supplies only the genuinely physical
inputs at `s=2*N-10`:

  * the new endpoint descent `c_(N-9) <= c_(N-10)`;
  * the `5/6` heat floor at exponent `2*N-8`, inherited monotonically from the
    already checked ninth-shell floor;
  * transport through the exact box/line reindex.

No shell support table or handwritten slack polynomial occurs here.
No `Classical`, `native_decide`, `sorry`, custom axiom, or noncomputable
declaration.
-/

